
====================================================================================================
A. Setup
====================================================================================================
  C engine built: scratch/procgen_cube/strategy_cube/engine  (source 04-computation/experiments/procgen_cube_20260925_engine.c)
  strategy sigma of level k: odd residues mod 2^k -> {+1,-1};  T(n) = n/2 (even), (3n + sigma(n mod 2^k))/2 (odd)
  mask bit i <-> residue 2i+1, bit 1 = minus.  Strings list sigma(1), sigma(3), ..., sigma(2^k-1).
  u/d word: at r, 'd' iff 4 | 3r + sigma(r) (>= 2 halvings follow), 'u' iff exactly one.
  critical odd density c = log_3 2 = 0.630929753571; a cycle (a odd steps, length p) is EXPANDING iff 3^a > 2^p iff a/p > c
  cycle-search budget at levels <= 5: positive starts 1..131072, value cap 2^60, Brent detection
  exact table amin(j) = least a with 3^a > 2^j checked for j <= 401 (the engine uses the same table)

