G. The provability boundary, checked on every strategy of levels 1-5
====================================================================================================
  checked on 65814 strategies:
   Theorem A:  (i) <=> every cycle of G_sigma has odd density < log_3 2 <=> Bad_L = empty for some L
   Theorem B:  (ii) <=> some bottom SCC has every cycle of odd density > log_3 2  (=> that trap has positive drift)
   sandwich:   rho_min(C) <= pi_odd(C) <= rho_max(C) on every bottom SCC C (drift = pi_odd log 3 - log 2)
