H3. Exact distances from Collatz to the provable classes (lazy-constraint MaxSAT / CP-SAT, solver-certified)
====================================================================================================
  delta_k = least number of odd residues mod 2^k at which sigma must differ from Collatz for class (i);
  eps_k   = the same for class (ii).  Lazy no-good clauses are necessary conditions, so the solver optimum is a
  lower bound, and the first optimum without offending cycles is optimal.  Every optimum is re-verified exactly.
  Lifting preserves the map, so delta_k / 2^(k-1) and eps_k / 2^(k-1) are non-increasing in k.
